cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Code and data for: Impact of atmospheric water vapor on the exchange of gases, especially O2"
abstract: "Python code and output data for the Stefan-Maxwell calculations of O2, H2O, N2 and CO2 diffusion in a tube (respiratory and photosynthetic variants) supporting Figs. 2-3 and the numerical-modelling appendix of the associated manuscript."
version: 1.0.0
# Update date-released to the actual release date when the GitHub release is published.
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - Stefan-Maxwell diffusion
  - water vapor
  - atmospheric oxygen
  - dry-air mole fraction
authors:
  - family-names: Keeling
    given-names: Ralph
    affiliation: "Scripps Institution of Oceanography, University of California San Diego"
